{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03894","headline":"西征军行遇风 · 崔融","name":"西征军行遇风","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北风卷尘沙，左右不相识。\n飒飒吹万里，昏昏同一色。\n马烦莫敢进，人急未遑食。\n曹木春更悲，天景昼相匿。\n夙龄慕忠义，雅尚存孤直。\n览史怀浸骄，读诗叹孔棘。\n及兹戎旅地，忝从书记职。\n兵气腾北荒，军声振西极。\n坐觉威灵远，行看氛祲息。\n愚臣何以报，倚马申微力。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03894.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03894","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}